<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Reorganise</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Mesh &gt; Reorganise</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span lang="EN-GB" class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Reorganise</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command rearranges edges of the visible selections to follow detection feature lines (e.g. corners). This command is grayed if there is no selection or all selections are hidden. It works on wholly selected entities as well as on partial selections.</span></p>
<p><span class="Command">Reorganise</span> <span lang="EN-GB">does not affect the triangles very much if applied to selection of edges, because it is impossible to extract any features from such selections. The best results are achieved if the command is applied to the whole mesh or area that contains both flat and featured surface.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
