<p><span class="Command">Reorganise</span> does not add or remove vertices and triangles. The difference is that it changes the mesh topology.</p>
<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span class="Command">Reorganise</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to orient triangles along the feature lines in order to get better shape of the edges.</span></p>

